{"id": "dac1135a-85da-426a-8644-46b94518f265", "slug": "cosmic-gravity-cta", "title": "Cosmic Gravity CTA", "description": "Cosmic Gravity Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Cosmic Gravity CTA\"\ndescription: \"Cosmic Gravity Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#F97316\"\n  secondary: \"#FB923C\"\n  accent: \"#FB923C\"\n  background: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  surface: \"#2C1202\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Cosmic Gravity CTA\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 6; favorites: 4; remixes: 0.\nTags: button, css, interactive, action.\n## Overview\nCosmic Gravity Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nVortex Engine Architecture Benchmarks Documentation Sign In Command the Void. Harness the localized gravity field to compress infinite workflows into a single point of interaction. Experience the absolute pull of our ne…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Command the Void..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F97316, secondary #FB923C, accent #FB923C, background #0A0A0A, surface #2C1202, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Cosmic Gravity CTA</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-black text-neutral-50 min-h-screen font-sans antialiased overflow-hidden relative selection:bg-orange-500/30\">\n\n    <!-- Interactive Particle Background Layer -->\n    <canvas id=\"vortex-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none w-full h-full\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Subtle Radial Gradient Background -->\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,rgba(249,115,22,0.03)_0%,rgba(0,0,0,0)_60%)] z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Container -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col min-h-screen\">\n\n        <!-- Minimal Navigation -->\n        <header class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-orange-400 transition-colors hover:text-orange-300\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:galaxy-linear\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-base font-medium tracking-tight\">Vortex Engine</span>\n            </a>\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-light text-neutral-400 hover:text-neutral-50 transition-colors\">Architecture</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-light text-neutral-400 hover:text-neutral-50 transition-colors\">Benchmarks</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-light text-neutral-400 hover:text-neutral-50 transition-colors\">Documentation</a>\n            </nav>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-neutral-50 hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors\">Sign In</a>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <main class=\"flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 text-center\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl tracking-tight font-medium text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-b from-neutral-50 to-neutral-500 mb-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto drop-shadow-sm\">\n                Command the Void.\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-light text-neutral-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 leading-relaxed\">\n                Harness the localized gravity field to compress infinite workflows into a single point of interaction. Experience the absolute pull of our next-generation engine.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Futuristic CTA Wrapper -->\n            <div class=\"relative inline-flex items-center justify-center w-48 h-16 group\">\n\n                <!-- Dynamic Glow Layer (Manipulated by JS) -->\n                <div id=\"vortex-glow\" class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 w-full h-full rounded-full pointer-events-none\"\n                     style=\"transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1); opacity: 0.4; box-shadow: 0 0 20px 5px rgba(249,115,22,0.1); transition: all 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\">\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- The Button -->\n                <button id=\"vortex-btn\" class=\"relative z-10 w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-neutral-950 border border-orange-500/20 text-orange-400 overflow-hidden cursor-pointer\"\n                        style=\"transition: all 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); transform: scale(1);\">\n\n                    <!-- Inner Background Flare -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500/0 via-orange-500/10 to-orange-500/0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700\"></div>\n\n                    <span class=\"relative z-10 text-base font-medium tracking-wide\">Engage Core</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-fall-linear\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"relative z-10 transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:rotate-[360deg]\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Particle Interaction Logic -->\n    <script>\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('vortex-canvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n        const btn = document.getElementById('vortex-btn');\n        const glow = document.getElementById('vortex-glow');\n\n        let width, height;\n        let targetX, targetY;\n        let mode = 'idle'; // 'idle', 'hover', 'click', 'burst'\n        let isAnimatingBurst = false;\n        let isHovering = false;\n\n        function resize() {\n            width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = window.innerHeight;\n            canvas.width = width;\n            canvas.height = height;\n        }\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n        resize();\n\n        // Sync button visual state\n        function updateGlow() {\n            if (mode === 'idle') {\n                glow.style.transform = 'translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1)';\n                glow.style.boxShadow = '0 0 20px 5px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.1)';\n                glow.style.opacity = '0.4';\n                btn.style.transform = 'scale(1)';\n                btn.style.borderColor = 'rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.2)';\n                btn.style.backgroundColor = '#0a0a0a';\n            } else if (mode === 'hover') {\n                glow.style.transform = 'translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.3)';\n                glow.style.boxShadow = '0 0 60px 20px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.6)';\n                glow.style.opacity = '0.85';\n                btn.style.transform = 'scale(1.04)';\n                btn.style.borderColor = 'rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.6)';\n                btn.style.backgroundColor = '#1a0b02';\n            } else if (mode === 'click') {\n                glow.style.transform = 'translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.6)';\n                glow.style.boxShadow = '0 0 10px 2px rgba(251, 146, 60, 1)';\n                glow.style.opacity = '1';\n                btn.style.transform = 'scale(0.96)';\n                btn.style.borderColor = 'rgba(251, 146, 60, 0.8)';\n                btn.style.backgroundColor = '#2c1202';\n            } else if (mode === 'burst') {\n                glow.style.transform = 'translate(-50%, -50%) scale(3.5)';\n                glow.style.boxShadow = '0 0 100px 40px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0)';\n                glow.style.opacity = '0';\n                btn.style.transform = 'scale(1.08)';\n                btn.style.borderColor = 'rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.1)';\n                btn.style.backgroundColor = '#0a0a0a';\n            }\n        }\n\n        // Event Listeners for Interaction\n        btn.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => {\n            isHovering = true;\n            if (!isAnimatingBurst) {\n                mode = 'hover';\n                updateGlow();\n            }\n        });\n\n        btn.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n            isHovering = false;\n            if (!isAnimatingBurst) {\n                mode = 'idle';\n                updateGlow();\n            }\n        });\n\n        btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n            if (isAnimatingBurst) return;\n            isAnimatingBurst = true;\n            mode = 'click';\n            updateGlow();\n\n            // Briefly collapse particles into center before the burst\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                mode = 'burst';\n                // Calculate high outward velocity for the burst\n                const rect = btn.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const tx = rect.left + rect.width / 2;\n                const ty = rect.top + rect.height / 2;\n\n                particles.forEach(p => {\n                    const angle = Math.atan2(p.y - ty, p.x - tx);\n                    const speed = Math.random() * 25 + 15;\n                    p.vx = Math.cos(angle) * speed;\n                    p.vy = Math.sin(angle) * speed;\n                });\n\n                updateGlow();\n\n                // Reset to contextual state after soft burst fades\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    isAnimatingBurst = false;\n                    mode = isHovering ? 'hover' : 'idle';\n                    updateGlow();\n                }, 800);\n            }, 300);\n        });\n\n        // Particle System Logic\n        class Particle {\n            constructor() {\n                this.reset(true);\n                this.history = [];\n            }\n\n            reset(randomize = false) {\n                this.x = randomize ? Math.random() * width : (Math.random() > 0.5 ? -10 : width + 10);\n                this.y = randomize ? Math.random() * height : Math.random() * height;\n                this.vx = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 1.5;\n                this.vy = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 1.5;\n                this.baseSize = Math.random() * 1.5 + 0.5;\n                this.color = Math.random() > 0.6 ? 'rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.8)' : 'rgba(253, 224, 71, 0.6)'; // Oranges and soft yellows\n                this.history = [];\n            }\n\n            update(tx, ty) {\n                // Record history for light streaks\n                this.history.push({x: this.x, y: this.y});\n                if (this.history.length > 10) this.history.shift();\n\n                const dx = tx - this.x;\n                const dy = ty - this.y;\n                const dist = Math.max(1, Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy));\n                const angle = Math.atan2(dy, dx);\n\n                if (mode === 'idle') {\n                    // Gentle ambient drifting\n                    const noiseAngle = Math.sin(this.x * 0.005) + Math.cos(this.y * 0.005);\n                    this.vx += Math.cos(noiseAngle) * 0.02;\n                    this.vy += Math.sin(noiseAngle) * 0.02;\n                    this.vx *= 0.98;\n                    this.vy *= 0.98;\n                } else if (mode === 'hover') {\n                    // Gravitational pull & swirling\n                    if (dist < 600) {\n                        const force = 350 / (dist + 50);\n                        const swirl = angle + Math.PI / 2.2; // slight inward curve\n                        this.vx += Math.cos(swirl) * force * 0.2 + Math.cos(angle) * force * 0.12;\n                        this.vy += Math.sin(swirl) * force * 0.2 + Math.sin(angle) * force * 0.12;\n                    }\n                    this.vx *= 0.96;\n                    this.vy *= 0.96;\n\n                    // If absorbed into the button, respawn outside to maintain flow\n                    if (dist < 30) this.reset();\n                } else if (mode === 'click') {\n                    // Violent collapse into center\n                    const force = 1500 / (dist + 10);\n                    this.vx += Math.cos(angle) * force;\n                    this.vy += Math.sin(angle) * force;\n                    this.vx *= 0.85;\n                    this.vy *= 0.85;\n                } else if (mode === 'burst') {\n                    // Momentum carries outward, heavy friction slows them down smoothly\n                    this.vx *= 0.92;\n                    this.vy *= 0.92;\n                }\n\n                this.x += this.vx;\n                this.y += this.vy;\n\n                // Screen wrapping for ambient drift\n                if (mode === 'idle' || mode === 'burst') {\n                    if (this.x < -20) { this.x = width + 20; this.history = []; }\n                    if (this.x > width + 20) { this.x = -20; this.history = []; }\n                    if (this.y < -20) { this.y = height + 20; this.history = []; }\n                    if (this.y > height + 20) { this.y = -20; this.history = []; }\n                }\n            }\n\n            draw() {\n                if (this.history.length < 2) return;\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(this.history[0].x, this.history[0].y);\n                for (let i = 1; i < this.history.length; i++) {\n                    ctx.lineTo(this.history[i].x, this.history[i].y);\n                }\n                ctx.strokeStyle = this.color;\n                ctx.lineWidth = this.baseSize;\n                ctx.lineCap = 'round';\n                ctx.stroke();\n            }\n        }\n\n        // Initialize and animate system\n        const particles = Array.from({length: 400}, () => new Particle());\n\n        function animate() {\n            // Slight opacity clear creates soft trailing effects independent of particle line history\n            ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25)';\n            ctx.fillRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            // Dynamically track button position\n            const rect = btn.getBoundingClientRect();\n            targetX = rect.left + rect.width / 2;\n            targetY = rect.top + rect.height / 2;\n\n            particles.forEach(p => {\n                p.update(targetX, targetY);\n                p.draw();\n            });\n\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n        }\n\n        animate();\n        updateGlow();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "cosmic-gravity-cta.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/cosmic-gravity-cta.jpg", "source_name": "cosmic-gravity-cta-DESIGN.md", "views": 76, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T09:35:54.748982+00:00"}